---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Terms — Somwave"
  description="Terms for using the Somwave website and services."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-accent-600">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink">Terms of service</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted">
      By using the Somwave website, client portal, and related services, you agree to these terms.
    </p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Services</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink">
      Each project is defined by a formal agreement or invoice. The portal displays information
      associated with your account; do not access another person's account.
    </p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Payments</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink">
      Invoices are recorded in USD. Available payment methods are shown on each invoice.
    </p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Service availability</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink">
      We work to keep our services reliable, but we cannot guarantee uninterrupted availability.
    </p>
    <a
      href="/nala-soo-xiriir"
      class="mt-10 inline-flex h-11 items-center rounded-md bg-primary px-5 text-sm font-semibold text-surface hover:bg-primary-600"
    >
      Questions? Contact us
    </a>
  </article>
</PageLayout>
